# Build outputs and caches
/buildlog/
/.build_lockfile.json

# pboProject drops its +O rename map beside the source it packed. It pairs every
# mangled name with the real one, so it is the deobfuscation key: never commit it.
*.obf

# pboProject scratch. The tool writes these into a source tree and removes them
# again, but a hard kill mid-pack can leave one behind. Both spellings of the
# prefix file: 4.31 deprecated the extensionless one, and a repo may still carry
# it from an older build.
$PBOPREFIX$
$PBOPREFIX$.txt
noscramble.lst

# Never commit signing keys.
*.biprivatekey
